    ["<Assistant_Title1>【焕然衣新】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得焕然衣新套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角后自动获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fresh Look】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation outfit.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain the Fresh Look outfit after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Automatically obtained after character creation.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\">飓风斧</>造成伤害提高15%，效果触发间隔从0.8秒缩短至0.6秒，滞涩的基础概率增加至90%。;\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\">净化之斩</>变为可充能2次的充能技能，且造成伤害提高15%。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011020\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Hurricane Axe </> damage increased by 15%, trigger interval reduced from 0.8s to 0.6s, and base probability of Stagnation increased to 90%. \n <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011010\" color=\"#f4a067\"> Purifying Slash </> becomes a skill with 2 charges, and damage is increased by 15%.",
    ["<P_Heart>（北大陆的最西边，也是因蒂斯的最西边，那是迷雾海。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The far west of the Northern Continent, and also the far west of Intis, that is the Fog Sea.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（听起来像非凡事件，不过他是普通人发现不了，所以被吓成这样……）</>好，我先去四处看看，说不定能找到什么异常。"] = "<P_Heart>(Sounds like a Beyonder incident, but since he's an ordinary person and couldn't detect it, that's why he's so terrified...) </>Alright, I'll go look around first. Maybe I'll find something unusual.",
    ["<P_Heart>（沉声）</>我已经不再质疑，唯有虔诚地侍奉，遵从他的意志。"] = "<P_Heart>(In a deep voice)</> I no longer question; I only serve piously and obey his will.",
