    ["他原本就是为了钱才会娶我母亲，后来外祖父过世后，他就霸占了外祖父留下的酒庄和钱财，还要嫌弃我的母亲只是富商的女儿，嫌弃她酿酒卖酒不够体面。我实在无法忍受，终于劝母亲找律师，准备将他送上法庭。"] = "He only married my mother for money. Later, after my grandfather passed away, he seized the winery and the wealth my grandfather left behind. He even looked down on my mother for being just a wealthy merchant's daughter, complaining that brewing and selling wine wasn't respectable enough. I couldn't stand it anymore and finally persuaded my mother to find a lawyer and prepare to take him to court.",
