    ["愿黑夜庇护你。迷途的灵魂，终会在这里找到归宿。"] = "May the Evernight protect you. Lost souls will eventually find their resting place here.",
    ["我们保证安静得像墙角的老鼠！每天天不亮就出门找活，绝不弄出动静……"] = "We guarantee to be as quiet as mice in the corner! We leave to find work before dawn every day and will never make a sound...",
