    ["没错，霍纳奇斯！你们知道吗，最最有趣的是，遗迹内没有发现这个国家的墓葬！这是为什么呢？"] = "Exactly, Hornacis! Do you know what the most interesting part is? No burials from this country have been found in the ruins! Why is that?",
