    ["装修规则1：用墙体、地板<Highlight>建成封闭区域后</>，会自动生成屋顶。\n装修规则2：可以将右上角的<Highlight>跟随视角</>切换成<Highlight>自由视角</>或<Highlight>俯视视角</>。\n装修规则3：应用<Highlight>奇迹建造</>和<Highlight>城堡模板</>后，再稍加修改就能有更好效果。\n装修规则4：多多使用<Highlight>透明地板</>。\n装修规则5：放置地板/墙壁后，<Highlight>长按地板/墙壁并拖拽</>，可以快速连铺。"] = "Decoration Rule 1: After building an enclosed area with walls and floors <Highlight> </>, a roof will be generated automatically. \n Decoration Rule 2: You can switch the <Highlight> Follow Camera </> in the top right corner to <Highlight> Free Camera </> or <Highlight> Top-Down View </>. \n Decoration Rule 3: After applying <Highlight> Miracle Building </> and <Highlight> Castle </> templates, you can achieve better results with slight modifications. \n Decoration Rule 4: Use <Highlight> Transparent Floors </> frequently. \n Decoration Rule 5: After placing a floor/wall, <Highlight> long-press the floor/wall and drag </> to quickly lay them in succession.",
